
''Original guide by Mr Pops A Lot''


Era code is an absolute mess on the levels of Yandere Dev and is unlike most other programming languages. Most people who just want to add dialogue get stuck at the learning EraBasic phase and often lose motivation before they can put their ideas on the page. This page will teach the basics of EraBasic and guides you to be able to mod TW and make your own content.

