</nowiki>

Under CALC_RANK_FUNCTION and CALC_RANK (in COMMON.erb) we can define what our numbers scale to. In our case we will be doing a -5 to 5 system

 <nowiki>
CASE &quot;MAX_11_SCALE&quot;
;for endurance scales
    SELECTCASE VAR_VALUE
        CASE IS &gt;= 5
            RANK = 0
            ;upper limit
        CASE IS &gt;= 4
            RANK = 1
        CASE IS &gt;= 3
            RANK = 2
        CASE IS &gt;= 2
            RANK = 3
        CASE IS &gt;= 1
            RANK = 4
        CASE IS &gt;= 0
            RANK = 5
            ; you start at 0
        CASE IS &gt;= -1
            RANK = 6
        CASE IS &gt;= -2
            RANK = 7
        CASE IS &gt;= -3
            RANK = 8
        CASE IS &gt;= -4
            RANK = 9
        CASEELSE
